# Admitted 16px/component first zip. The command waits on source phases rather
# than fixed frame counts: entry pose is frozen for the 20f aim, then the first
# Zip lasts at most 5f and End opens its 9f direction window. Releasing Up on
# Start entry leaves a horizontal air aim. This authored corridor has a wall at
# $0B:D2, so the direct game must stop there rather than pretending that the
# synthetic clear-corridor 80px host-unit proof also proves local clearance.
# Neutralizing Right as soon as Zip1 is observed prevents a second point.
HOLD RIGHT
HOLD UP
HOLD B
WAIT_FOREIGN_STATE QUICK_ATTACK_START
RELEASE B
RELEASE UP
WAIT_FOREIGN_STATE QUICK_ATTACK_ZIP1
RELEASE RIGHT
DUMP_RAM 0060 40
DUMP_RAM 06D0 B0
ASSERT_RAM8 006D 0B admitted midzip player page
